1.0.0 (2026-09-16)
https://github.com/LlamaYeYe/CARAVAN
- Initial public release of Caravan for the Wand Company Pip-Boy 3000.
- Added player-vs-CPU Caravan with randomized Fallout: New Vegas opponents, face cards, Jokers, betting, tutorial, configurable audio, resident-runtime rematches, and animated cap results.
- Added low-memory lifecycle logging for firmware 1.1.6 hardware testing.
